      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَاعِفُ</span></b>  [a pl. of which the sing. is not mentioned,] The <i>nose and the parts around it.</i> (O,
K.) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَعَلْتُ ذَاكَ عَلَى الرَّغْمِ مِنْ مَرَاعِفِهِ</span>,
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَاغِمِهِ</span>. (S, O. * [See art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رغم</span>.])

